---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section care-support" aria-labelledby="support-title">
  <div class="container split-layout">
    <div class="split-intro"><h2 id="support-title">Support Beyond Your Treatment.</h2><p>As you focus on recovery, our team helps with medical documentation and treatment arrangements.</p><a href="#contact-us" class="button button-light">Talk to our team<Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={18} /></a></div>
    <div class="support-items">
      <article><h3><Icon name="FileText" size={26} />Legal Documentation.</h3><p>We maintain detailed medical records of your condition and treatments, and provide this documentation to your attorney.</p></article>
      <article><h3><Icon name="ShieldCheck" size={26} />We Accept Your Auto Insurance.</h3><p>We work on a medical lien. A medical lien means the insurance companies will pay us once your case is resolved.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
